S gate (OOS failure ⇒ REJECTED — proven on 70D).</p><div class='bento-meta'><a class='chip' href='../de/research/methodology/'>Methodology →</a> <a class='chip' href='../de/research/validation/'>Validation →</a></div></div></div></section>
